## Crafting Simple Toast Notifications with React Context (Emphasis on Helpfulness & Clarity)

While dedicated toast libraries exist, demonstrating the core concept using React Context offers valuable insight into data sharing and state management. Here's a breakdown, prioritizing clarity for maximum helpfulness:

**1. Create a Context:**

