This script outlines the **structured approach** and **code snippets**  to provision an AWS EC2 instance hosting a React frontend with a Python/Django backend, prioritizing both **helpfulness** and **detailed verbosity** for clarity.

**1. Infrastructure Setup (Terraform - Recommended for Management)**

